WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.567
Use the support message as a concrete prompting example: “My account was charged twice and I need a refund.” A vague

00:00:07.567 --> 00:00:14.707
request such as “Analyze this message” leaves many decisions undefined.

00:00:14.707 --> 00:00:21.597
A stronger prompt defines the allowed categories and requests a specific machine-readable output containing category,

00:00:21.597 --> 00:00:29.542
urgency, and summary. Better prompting is not about making the prompt longer.

00:00:29.542 --> 00:00:33.022
It is about making the requirements clearer and testable.
